-- Every app place's About and links (BP app docs/plans/place-photos, ticket 08), on top of the
-- websites 20261017190000_place_page.sql filled. Data only; written by place_pages.py
-- (~/Documents/designs/artifacts/place-photos/pages/) from found.json, searched.json and the
-- agent's picks, each reason in notes.json.
--
-- about: the place's own website description, word for word, cut at its last full sentence and
-- without a closing "contact us today" (Jesse, 2026-10-17). Three left out by eye: keyword text
-- (Floor to Ceiling, Floral Arts) and a description of a practice in another town (Laser Dentistry).
-- links: website first, then Facebook, then Instagram. A place's own website's links come first;
-- else Overture's places data (Meta's page for the place, matched by name within 250 m); else, for
-- five, a web search's answer. Display only: none of them is a watched source.
